  "set.goalAuto": "Goal mode: approve in 10 s",
  "set.goalAutoNote": "After you set a task with /goal, an action outside its grant that the Agent J host can undo (committed in git, moved to the trash, a push to a remote it already has) shows a 10-second countdown card and counts as approved if you don't tap, so the goal can finish while you sleep or sit in a meeting. Anything that can't be undone, and anything that looks like an attack, always waits for you. For a company or team, switch it off: those cards then only wait for your tap.",
