  "ar.claudeNote": "Sign in again: the Agent J host runs the official `claude setup-token` and sends you its authorize link; open it in any browser signed in to claude.ai, approve, and paste the code the page shows into the secret card — the Agent J host gets a one-year token. Paste an existing token: run `claude setup-token` on any computer with Claude Code and paste the token into the secret card. Both are live-checked before they are saved.",
