  "imsg.navNote": "Reads this Mac's messages; sends you what matters.",
  "imsg.intro": "Agent J looks at new iMessages and texts on this Mac on a schedule. Codes, deliveries, bank, travel and family messages come to this phone; spam and scams are held back. It only reads: it never replies, never marks anything as read and never changes anything in Messages.",
